      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>图标</color>\n<color=#ffffff>描述</color>",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/c80da47dee08e0ec7e4b91f39795ab00_3121207884496607804.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7299,
        "name": "玛薇卡",
        "desc": "纳塔的领袖，继承「基扬戈兹」之古名，誓以圣火为战争国度照亮未来。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/12/30/2f098b1f15854fd9dafc54998795a59e_864981592196815761.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "源火点亮世界，人类在「基扬戈兹」的带领下，第一次走向未来。"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/12/27/41133912/fa599362eacd85a017c865d4601ff4b8_1563082383897149467.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7502,
        "name": "伊安珊",
        "desc": "沃陆之邦健身俱乐部的总教练，闻名纳塔的营养师。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/25/dd9a200a86b792fb1b73ef1ee7de0911_2097378734184941134.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「乌威佐」向每位孤独悲伤之人伸出的手，充满力量。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7303,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/98b4df15f7de155719c57691131b4b6d_7885270586108717259.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7079,
        "name": "欧洛伦",
        "desc": "来自烟谜主的年轻人，却与万千生灵一起，生活在原野之中。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/11/18/e4830690f8b6a1ebb02cfbc8ce955671_8091252479018770784.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "为了所爱之地，「庇笛」甘愿献出一切。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/52f9f3a3da9e104dd3e2ad5dbe29ff19_5703780432960942661.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6318,
        "name": "卡齐娜",
        "desc": "纳茨卡延的年轻战士，受赐古名「乌沙博蒂」。善良执着的少女，在挫折中不断成长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/26925adb1092d29c8afdf46d92fad8bd_343637410022641529.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "你的鼓励，让「乌沙博蒂」第一次品尝到胜利的滋味。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6822,
        "name": "归火圣夜巡礼",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/20856775/8d026241b4633ed726e023cc1c89d58f_6910090665102684115.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/a31e5199c3ef2e61f07f6701ddb2e1a0_1255358345181997675.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7467,
        "name": "派蒙",
        "desc": "<p>旅行者最好的朋友和提瓦特的向导。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/20/326985891/03dba4da579ab5b8b961694be289266d_2491104401959786128.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "超越命运的星星，和最好的伙伴。"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/4e13d5c0c332b058afcde885c2b52ccb_9099827278592122538.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6924,
        "name": "希诺宁",
        "desc": "纳茨卡延的铸名师，善于在工作的重担与舒适的生活之间找到平衡点。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/25/b07074c2b9040516fd240b6b8d65c011_2487211347344319683.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "与「巴莱卡」共同找回了真实的灵魂，并祝她从此幸福顺遂。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7108,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/991c562c416ac2841f1c70f0c3bf63c0_7644869823437679449.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6317,
        "name": "基尼奇",
        "desc": "维茨特兰的猎龙人，精于度量代价。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/12/0099e74b4d0c919f6feab4bade3ab748_5795733017114624391.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "正如经受住火焰洗礼的「马力卜」所言，万事皆有代价。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6989,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 38
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/3d833511d9cfa01d1f3c1c798d4165aa_719868844123067070.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6319,
        "name": "玛拉妮",
        "desc": "纳塔远近闻名的向导，水上用品商店的经营者，精通各类水上运动的逐浪客。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/f4c75caad42923eb91ee760aa2eb473a_7439123622315070718.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一同探寻神秘岛的过程，是「沃摩延」心中永远闪耀之物。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6980,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 38
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/12/27/41133912/e9ccc35cf22df216a0101971e41e5a75_5278064390250543066.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "有流灰之城与炽热之心相伴，你逐层向上，将历史尽收眼底。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7390,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/22/237301566/c92a0ff14098a6e9f67bc3b42eb2d73a_8685697107976243393.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7013,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "走遍山河湖海，它逐渐认识世界，你也逐渐知晓使命。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6969,
        "name": "自过往的启示",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/01/05/20856775/1c0f22a859063af0403353b6fad40a28_3726718211264607569.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/12/27/41133912/fece3d298a7908af9fb0a6bd70a33ae7_3953378626312806548.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7080,
        "name": "恰斯卡",
        "desc": "特拉洛坎的「调停人」，万千争端的终结者。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/11/18/abe1192cc7aad45f6b273478dd5fa88a_4799372826012752249.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "「武卡」注定超越苦难，回应所有深爱之人的期待。\n<color=#ffffff>达成条件：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7372,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      }
    ]
  }
}